    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Dragonborn Fenari dress to dazzle, and their jewelry and scales catch the light like a hoard. When a creature you can see hits you with an attack roll, you can take a Reaction to flash your finery at it, imposing Disadvantage on that attack roll. Once you use this trait, you can't do so again until you finish a Long Rest.</p><p><em>Foundry note: use it when the hit is announced; the attacker rerolls with Disadvantage.</em></p>",
